  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la transformacin digital del rgano Judicial de Panam</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Digital Transformation of Panamas Judiciary</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es mejorar la resolucin oportuna de los procesos judiciales. Los objetivos de desarrollo especficos son incrementar: (i) la eficiencia en la gestin de los servicios judiciales; (ii) la cobertura de los servicios judiciales digitales; y (iii) la transparencia de la administracin judicial.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to improve the timely resolution of judicial processes. The specific development objectives are to increase: (i) efficiency in the management of judicial services; (ii) coverage of digital judicial services; and (iii) transparency of judicial administration.</narrative>
  </description>
